  "id": "yrel",
  "name": "Yrel",
  "role": "Bruiser",
  "overview": "Yrel is a resistant Bruiser who excels at creating opportunities to decide fights in her team's favor. Since all of her Basic Abilities come with a short wind-up time, it is extremely important to think ahead when playing Yrel in order to avoid getting interrupted or missing the right moment to strike.",
  "strengths": [
    "Good self-sustain",
    "High waveclear",
    "Good point control",
    "Capable of interrupting",
    "Good mobility",
    "High durability"
  ],
  "weaknesses": [
    "Vulnerable to crowd control",
    "Predictable engage",
    "Susceptible to getting kited",
    "Bad at clearing Mercenary Camps"
  ],
