    ],
    "explanation": "Thanks to her excellent waveclear, Yrel does better on Maps where she can double soak. After gaining priority over the enemy Offlaner, she can rotate to force a fight with a numerical advantage over the enemy team.\n\nWhen contesting a Capture Point, Yrel can make use of her survivability to buy time and rely on Righteous Hammer to Knock enemy Heroes away. This is not only useful for securing Mercenary Camps but also for controlling some Objectives.\n\nYrel can unleash her true potential on Maps where there are various spots to flank by manually charging up Avenging Wrath while hidden, jump over impassable terrain to close the distance, and still have Divine Purpose to instantly fully-charge Righteous Hammer."
  },
